Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.24,0:11:49.03,Main,,0,0,0,,上！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.90,0:11:56.02,Main,,0,0,0,,你真是礙眼！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.20,0:12:02.13,Main,,0,0,0,,開火！他在屋頂上方！
