Comment: 0,0:34:15.92,0:34:19.73,Lunch Time,,0,0,0,karaoke,{\i1}It's superb! This sweetness{!\i}
Comment: 0,0:34:19.73,0:34:23.30,Lunch Time,,0,0,0,karaoke,{\i1}I know I've tasted it somewhere!{\i}
Comment: 0,0:34:23.30,0:34:29.10,Lunch Time,,0,0,0,karaoke,{\i1}It's delicious!{\i}
Comment: 0,0:37:10.76,0:37:12.39,Lunch Time,,0,0,0,karaoke,Fluffy!
Comment: 0,0:37:12.89,0:37:14.56,Lunch Time,,0,0,0,karaoke,Munch!
Comment: 0,0:37:14.56,0:37:16.35,Lunch Time,,0,0,0,karaoke,Gulp!
Comment: 0,0:37:18.98,0:37:19.94,Lunch Time,,0,0,0,karaoke,Fluffy!
Comment: 0,0:37:19.94,0:37:20.98,Lunch Time,,0,0,0,karaoke,Munch!
Comment: 0,0:37:20.98,0:37:21.90,Lunch Time,,0,0,0,karaoke,Gulp!
Comment: 0,0:37:23.02,0:37:23.82,Lunch Time,,0,0,0,karaoke,Fluffy!
Comment: 0,0:37:23.82,0:37:24.94,Lunch Time,,0,0,0,karaoke,Munch!
Comment: 0,0:37:24.94,0:37:25.90,Lunch Time,,0,0,0,karaoke,Gulp!
Comment: 0,0:37:27.32,0:37:28.35,Lunch Time,,0,0,0,karaoke,What...
Comment: 0,0:37:29.20,0:37:30.17,Lunch Time,,0,0,0,karaoke,is this?!
Comment: 0,0:37:30.87,0:37:34.79,Lunch Time,,0,0,0,karaoke,Dreamy... taste?
Comment: 0,0:37:32.92,0:37:34.79,Lunch Time,,0,0,80,karaoke,Flower! Flower!
Comment: 0,0:37:34.79,0:37:38.97,Lunch Time,,0,0,0,karaoke,It's something that's beyond my wildest dreams!
Comment: 0,0:37:38.97,0:37:42.97,Lunch Time,,0,0,0,karaoke,I can't even find the words to describe it!
Comment: 0,0:37:42.97,0:37:44.89,Lunch Time,,0,0,0,karaoke,What? What?
Comment: 0,0:37:44.89,0:37:46.93,Lunch Time,,0,0,0,karaoke,What's this flavor?
Comment: 0,0:37:46.93,0:37:50.94,Lunch Time,,0,0,0,karaoke,It's making rotten puppies start dancing!
Comment: 0,0:37:50.94,0:37:53.91,Lunch Time,,0,0,0,karaoke,The flavor is concentrated like...
Comment: 0,0:37:53.91,0:37:59.88,Lunch Time,,0,0,0,karaoke,A pet cemetery!
Comment: 0,0:38:10.87,0:38:13.01,Lunch Time,,0,0,0,karaoke,It's sweet!
Comment: 0,0:38:11.96,0:38:13.01,Lunch Time,,0,0,80,karaoke,It's sweet.
Comment: 0,0:38:13.01,0:38:15.05,Lunch Time,,0,0,0,karaoke,It's milky!
Comment: 0,0:38:13.87,0:38:15.89,Lunch Time,,0,0,80,karaoke,It's milky!
Comment: 0,0:38:15.05,0:38:19.97,Lunch Time,,0,0,0,karaoke,It's very rich and...
Comment: 0,0:38:17.01,0:38:21.18,Lunch Time,,0,0,80,karaoke,It's very rich and...
Comment: 0,0:38:22.18,0:38:24.98,Lunch Time,,0,0,0,karaoke,risky!
Comment: 0,0:38:31.06,0:38:36.98,Lunch Time,,0,0,0,karaoke,Look! Yes, it's a big fuss!
Comment: 0,0:38:35.02,0:38:36.98,Lunch Time,,0,0,80,karaoke,Ship! Ship!
Comment: 0,0:38:36.98,0:38:46.42,Lunch Time,,0,0,0,karaoke,It's like when you throw a bomb into an amusement park!
Comment: 0,0:38:49.99,0:38:52.07,Lunch Time,,0,0,0,karaoke,Like your stomach is having...
Comment: 0,0:38:52.07,0:38:57.13,Lunch Time,,0,0,0,karaoke,A big ceremony
Comment: 0,0:39:03.22,0:39:06.76,Lunch Time,,0,0,0,karaoke,Hey, Mother...
Comment: 0,0:39:06.76,0:39:15.94,Lunch Time,,0,0,0,karaoke,Can you taste this overflowing happy sweetness?
Comment: 0,0:39:18.98,0:39:20.27,Lunch Time,,0,0,0,karaoke,Oh, yeah!
Comment: 0,0:39:20.32,0:39:24.71,Lunch Time,,0,0,0,karaoke,It's the flavor of happiness...
Comment: 0,0:39:24.71,0:39:29.99,Lunch Time,,0,0,0,karaoke,from back then!
Comment: 0,0:39:36.96,0:39:45.01,Lunch Time,,0,0,0,karaoke,Let's eat again together someday!
Comment: 0,0:39:45.01,0:39:46.87,Lunch Time,,0,0,0,karaoke,It's sweet!
Comment: 0,0:39:45.93,0:39:48.16,Lunch Time,,0,0,80,karaoke,It's sweet
Comment: 0,0:39:46.87,0:39:48.97,Lunch Time,,0,0,0,karaoke,It's milky!
Comment: 0,0:39:48.32,0:39:50.53,Lunch Time,,0,0,80,karaoke,It's milky!
Comment: 0,0:39:48.97,0:39:56.00,Lunch Time,,0,0,0,karaoke,It's very rich and...
Comment: 0,0:39:51.14,0:39:56.52,Lunch Time,,0,0,80,karaoke,It's very rich and...
Comment: 0,0:39:56.52,0:39:59.44,Lunch Time,,0,0,0,karaoke,risky!
Comment: 0,0:40:13.24,0:40:17.04,Lunch Time,,0,0,0,karaoke,Hey Mother, do you think...
Comment: 0,0:40:17.04,0:40:19.12,Lunch Time,,0,0,0,karaoke,I can do this?
Comment: 0,0:40:20.94,0:40:25.21,Lunch Time,,0,0,0,karaoke,Everyone's happy!
Comment: 0,0:40:25.21,0:40:28.94,Lunch Time,,0,0,0,karaoke,It's a peaceful utopia!
Comment: 0,0:40:28.94,0:40:37.13,Lunch Time,,0,0,0,karaoke,It doesn't discriminate by race!
Comment: 0,0:40:37.13,0:40:44.43,Lunch Time,,0,0,0,karaoke,If you try to leave, I'll kill you though...!
Comment: 0,0:40:44.43,0:40:48.91,Lunch Time,,0,0,0,karaoke,It's a devilish contract!
Comment: 0,0:40:48.91,0:40:53.07,Lunch Time,,0,0,0,karaoke,The peaceful Totto Land!
Comment: 0,0:40:53.07,0:40:56.82,Lunch Time,,0,0,0,karaoke,We're all family!
Comment: 0,0:40:56.82,0:41:01.84,Lunch Time,,0,0,0,karaoke,The gentle queen...
Comment: 0,0:41:02.62,0:41:03.95,Lunch Time,,0,0,0,karaoke,Big Mom!
Comment: 0,0:41:16.93,0:41:19.04,Lunch Time,,0,0,0,karaoke,It was delicious.
Comment: 0,0:41:19.04,0:41:21.63,Lunch Time,,0,0,0,karaoke,Thank you for the meal!

